  "Anime.js (animejs.com): the one library to make anything on your page move."
 ],
 "content": "Five websites every vibe coder should know. 1. Motion Primitives: animated components you can copy straight into your site. 2. Watermelon UI: free clean landing page layouts. 3. Kokonut UI: ready-made cards and buttons you can hand straight to Claude. 4. Bklit UI: every interactive chart you could possibly need. 5. Anime.js: the one library to make anything on your page move. All five links are in my bio. Save this for your next design.\n\nTranscript: is your website when you want like this 5 Websi vibe coders need quality sites Motion Primitives (motion-primitives.com) animated can copy straight into your site with zero code Watermelon UI (ui.watermelon.sh) landing page layouts KokonutUI (kokonutui.com) these are and buttons that straight to Bklit UI (ui.bklit.com) single you may possibly need Anime.js (animejs.com) and Anime.js to make anything move around all 5 links are in my BIO\n\nOn-screen text: 5 Websites Every Vibe Coder Should Know, Motion Primitives (motion-primitives.com), Watermelon UI (ui.watermelon.sh), KokonutUI (kokonutui.com), Bklit UI (ui.bklit.com), Anime.js (animejs.com)",
